  "claim": "This film producer produced Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers. It also produced the film that National Treasure: Book of Secrets is a sequel to and The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes.",
  "evidencia": "Page: National Treasure (film). Sentence: National Treasure is a 2004 American adventure heist film produced and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\nPage: The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes. Sentence: It was produced by Walt Disney Productions and distributed by Buena Vista Distribution Company as part of \"The Last Laughs of the 1960s\".\nPage: National Treasure: Book of Secrets. Sentence: It is a sequel to the 2004 film \"National Treasure\" and is the second part of the \"National Treasure\" franchise.\nPage: Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers. Sentence: This film was directed by Donovan Cook, produced by Walt Disney Pictures and DisneyToon Studios, and released directly to VHS and DVD on August 17, 2004, by Walt Disney Studios Home Entertainment, and was later re-released on Blu-ray Disc on August 12, 2014, coinciding with the film's 10th anniversary.",
