        "original_id": "da4b404b-839f-5645-be12-7afd7d5e22ea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: National Treasure, The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes, National Treasure: Book of Secrets, Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney Productions, Buena Vista Distribution Company, DisneyToon Studios, Walt Disney Studios Home Entertainment\n- People: Donovan Cook\n- Concepts: National Treasure franchise\n\nFacts:\n- The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes was produced by Walt Disney Productions and distributed by Buena Vista Distribution Company as part of “The Last Laughs of the 1960s.”\n- National Treasure is a 2004 American adventure heist film produced and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers was directed by Donovan Cook, produced by Walt Disney Pictures and DisneyToon Studios, and released directly to VHS and DVD on August 17, 2004, by Walt Disney Studios Home Entertainment.\n- National Treasure: Book of Secrets is a sequel to the 2004 film National Treasure and is the second part of the National Treasure franchise.\n- Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers was re-released on Blu-ray Disc on August 12, 2014, coinciding with the film’s 10th anniversary.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
